ound 6700-6800): These show King Triton and Ursula facing each other, which could represent the climax where Triton confronts Ursula.\n\n2. **Prince Eric and Ariel scenes** (various frames): These show romantic interactions between the main characters.\n\n3. **Frame 7443** shows credits/acknowledgments, which typically appear at the very end of a performance.\n\nThe credits frame (7443) is particularly important because it suggests the very end of the video. However, I need to see what happens immediately before the credits to identify the last major event.\n\nLet me query frames around the credits to see the final scenes of the performance.\n\n```json\n{\n    "tool": "VLM_QUERY",\n    "frames": ["frames/frame_7400.jpg", "frames/frame_7410.jpg", "frames/frame_7420.jpg", "frames/frame_7430.jpg", "frames/frame_7440.jpg", "frames/frame_7450.jpg", "frames/frame_7460.jpg", "frames/frame_7470.jpg", "frames/frame_7480.jpg", "frames/frame_7490.jpg", "frames/frame_7500.jpg"],\n    "prompt": "Describe what is happening in these frames. Is this part of the theatrical performance, or is it credits/acknowledgments? If it\'s the performance, describe the scene, characters, and actions. If it\'s credits, describe what information is being displayed."\n}\n```'}, {'role': 'vlm response', 'content': {'batched_responses': [{'batch_start': 0, 'batch_end': 11, 'image_paths': ['/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/xECIRjlxM3U/frames/frame_7400.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/xECIRjlxM3U/frames/frame_7410.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/xECIRjlxM3U/frames/frame_7420.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/xECIRjlxM3U/frames/frame_7430.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/xECIRjlxM3U/frames/frame_7440.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/xECIRjlxM3U/frames/frame_7450.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/xECIRjlxM3U/frames/frame_7460.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/xECIRjlxM3U/frames/frame_7470.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data